{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"USN-8955-1","published":"2026-10-26T15:34:05Z","modified":"2026-10-26T22:46:19.977872622Z","related":["UBUNTU-CVE-2026-15176","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-93479","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-95101","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-97205","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-97629"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-15176","CVE-2026-93479","CVE-2026-95101","CVE-2026-97205","CVE-2026-97629","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-15176","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-93479","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-95101","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-97205","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-97629"],"summary":"nginx vulnerabilities","details":"It was discovered that nginx incorrectly handled certain configurations\nusing the alias directive together with rewrite rules. A remote attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to cause nginx to crash, resulting in a\ndenial of service, or execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-15176)\n\nIt was discovered that nginx incorrectly handled map directives using\nregex matching under certain circumstances. A remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause nginx to crash, resulting in a denial\nof service, or execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-93479)\n\nIt was discovered that nginx incorrectly handled HTTP/3 requests when\nproxy_request_buffering was enabled. This issue only affected\nUbuntu 26.04 LTS and Ubuntu 26.10. A remote attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to inject data into proxied requests.\n(CVE-2026-95101)\n\nIt was discovered that nginx incorrectly handled asynchronous file I/O\nin certain configurations with Server Side Includes pages. A remote\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause nginx to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service, or execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-97205)\n\nIt was discovered that nginx incorrectly handled SSL session ticket keys\nwhen configured with a shared session cache but without explicit ticket\nkey rotation. This issue only affected Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, Ubuntu 26.04 LTS,\nand Ubuntu 26.10. A remote attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to forge client SSL sessions and bypass\nclient certificate verification.\n(CVE-2026-97629)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"nginx","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:22.04:LTS","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/nginx?arch=source&distro=jammy"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"}]}],"versions":["1.18.0-6ubuntu11","1.18.0-6ubuntu12","1.18.0-6ubuntu14","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.1","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.2","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.3","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.4","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.5","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.6","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.7","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.8","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.10","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.11","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.12","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.13","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.14","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.15","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.16","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.17","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.18","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.19","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.20","1.18.0-6ubuntu14.21"],"ecosystem_specific":{"availability":"No subscription required","binaries":[{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-echo","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-fancyindex","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-geoip","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-geoip2","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-headers-more-filter","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-image-filter","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-ndk","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-perl","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-subs-filter","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-uploadprogress","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ubuntu14.22"},{"binary_name":"libnginx-mod-http-upstream-fair","binary_version":"1.18.0-6ub